# Whitelist: only our own code goes into git.
# Everything derived from the game (romfs/, icon.png, screenshots, .3dsx,
# ../extracted, ../sts2-decompiled) stays local and is regenerated with
# tools/build_assets.py from your own copy of the game.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/CLAUDE.md
!/.gitattributes
!/Makefile
!/Makefile.sdl
!/source/
!/tools/
!/test/
!/docs/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
